{"ID":"20250915194154-ylyweu7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250915194154-ylyweu7","title":"UPL4-2——生命周期函数的问题","type":"doc","updated":"20250915201443"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194155-1i6wick","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194155-1i6wick","updated":"20250915201443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生命周期函数的调用顺序"}]},{"ID":"20250915194215-lir52v8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194215-lir52v8","updated":"20250915194224"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在进行性能调试和问题定位时，如果不了解或忽略生命周期函数的执行顺序，可能会导致调试误判或遗漏真实性能问题"}]},{"ID":"20250915194226-y3e2mw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194226-y3e2mw9","updated":"20250915194226"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比如："}]},{"ID":"20250915194221-ghyzjm6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194221-ghyzjm6","updated":"20250915201443"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194221-9d7lxd2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194221-9d7lxd2","updated":"20250915194221"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194221-12fer0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194221-12fer0b","updated":"20250915194221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"错误归因性能开销的位置"}]},{"ID":"20250915194227-owbw2am","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194227-owbw2am","updated":"20250915194252"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在 Profiler 中看到帧开头有较大开销\n误以为是某个 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 耗时过长，但实际是前面的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Start()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 或 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"OnEnable()"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 初始化造成的\n我们不能只是关注 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 部分，也要关注在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Awake"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"OnEnable"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Start"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中的逻辑\n因为也可能是因为某些逻辑初始化造成的卡顿"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194221-2n5tfl0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194221-2n5tfl0","updated":"20250915201443"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194221-bcapun3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194221-bcapun3","updated":"20250915194259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逻辑初始化顺序错乱导致异常"}]},{"ID":"20250915194303-23xp9ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194303-23xp9ee","updated":"20250915200330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景中不同脚本中的相同生命周期函数的执行时机是不确定的\n当两个脚本相互依赖时，比如 A 依赖 B 中的初始化数据\n那么我们一定要保证 A 在使用 B 数据时，B 已经被初始化了"}]},{"ID":"20250915200751-uo8y5ja","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915200751-uo8y5ja","updated":"20250915201443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果要指定某些脚本生命周期函数执行的优先级，可以在 Project Setting 内的 Script Execution Order 内进行配置\n详见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708144948-o5ngoop","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"U1L2——生命周期函数"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708153044-h0l4h8t","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"不同脚本间生命周期函数的执行顺序"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 部分"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194219-pgqipp6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194219-pgqipp6","updated":"20250915194219"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20250915194305-609pl0x","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250915194305-609pl0x","updated":"20250915194410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不用的生命周期函数"}]},{"ID":"20250915194323-yn8lanq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194323-yn8lanq","updated":"20250915194349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果在脚本中定义了生命周期函数，但没有在其中写任何逻辑，他们仍然会带来额外的性能开销，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因此我们要避免在脚本中写空的生命周期函数，特别是那些会每帧调用的生命周期函数"}]},{"ID":"20250915194349-wobnieu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-wobnieu","updated":"20250915194410"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194349-ya223ne","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-ya223ne","updated":"20250915194401"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194349-xebfkb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-xebfkb9","updated":"20250915194401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708150946-fi9ybwn","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194349-7jpp9mj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-7jpp9mj","updated":"20250915194404"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194349-bahoyi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-bahoyi9","updated":"20250915194404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708150954-t2fbdtv","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"LateUpdate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]},{"ID":"20250915194349-xhg68ga","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-xhg68ga","updated":"20250915194407"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250915194349-g1d3ry0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250915194349-g1d3ry0","updated":"20250915194407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"Nod